   "value": "The White House Office serves the President in the performance of the many detailed activities incident to his immediate office.\r\rThe President's staff facilitates and maintains communication with the Congress, the heads of executive agencies, the press and other information media, and the general public. \r\rThe various Assistants to the President aid the President in such matters as he may direct.",
